// The admitted side of the E-POS-SIMULTANEOUS cap: `Simultaneous` and
// `GainControl` INSIDE the exchange-family `ExchangeControl` macro's body
// ([CR#701.12a..701.12b]) — the exchange-control card shape ("exchange
// control of two target creatures"), whose halves read one pre-application
// snapshot and land as one batch.
Normal(
  name: "Accept Exchange Control",
  mana_cost: [Generic(2), Blue],
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Targeted(
      targets: [
        As("first", Target(Exactly(1), Type(Creature))),
        As("second", Target(Exactly(1), Type(Creature))),
      ],
      effect: ExchangeControl(The("first"), The("second")),
    )),
  ],
)
